        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Play, win, enjoy! </strong>A casual, retro-inspired casino sim RPG.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/1348da4e935ab472c89db8f1f4fd6579.avif?t=1781080512\" width=940 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Explore <strong>5</strong> different game lounges!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/edec6260c1353187820a7aad26c78ca2.avif?t=1781080512\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras_big/edec6260c1353187820a7aad26c78ca2.webp?t=1781080512 width=1560 height=239 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Play games to <strong>unlock trophies</strong> and <strong>new areas</strong>!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/67d8c4c2718141e075c28a4d8d1b7873.apng?t=1781080512\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/67d8c4c2718141e075c28a4d8d1b7873.poster.avif?t=1781080512\" class=\"bb_img\" width=500 height=166 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Roam the <strong>JUPITER JACKPOT RESORT.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Teleport to different locations with your handy <strong>TelePod</strong>!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/4ed8cfa4de77b8e17b4c1ff48a95433e.avif?t=1781080512\" width=100 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">I<i>mmerse yourself in the game world with its' unique <strong>pixel art style</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/0860a54329cc9e3c32d8b0312e508d5c.avif?t=1781080512\" width=816 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Catch a view of Jupiter from the many <strong>viewing ports</strong> and <strong>lounges</strong>.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>and <strong>MORE</strong>!</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/6b42213dbb7037f2f31378ce251ee692.poster.avif?t=1781080512\" width=256 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/6b42213dbb7037f2f31378ce251ee692.webm?t=1781080512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941500/extras/c29f1df3d6473d842bbd146d26eb9c4f.avif?t=1781080512\" width=816 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUPITER JACKPOT CASINO™</strong> is a casual, retro inspired, 2D pixel-art, single player RPG sim.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ Information ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Windows PC Version: </strong>The desktop version of JJC™ uses a custom launcher. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please review the Game Launcher Instructions PDF file to get to know our launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many features we plan on implementing and constant improvements and updates are being made during development. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[ FAQ ]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: <u>What gameplay is there in JUPITER JACKPOT™? </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: The gameplay is centered around playing versions of popular games such as Blackjack 21, Roulette, and so forth. The player controls their character and interacts with game machines, shops, and other items and interfaces. There's no real goal, just have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: <u>Are there customization options?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Yes, there are! Current features allow players to choose some different skin colors, outfits, and room styles. Right now, we're in the middle of adding more of these options and planning out a super fun customization feature, though it might not be ready until 1.0. Stay tuned.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: <u>What is the premise?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: The premise of JJC™ is that your character has gone to a resort in orbit of the planet Jupiter, where there are tons of fun games to play and things to see and do from events to collectables! There isn't a fixed story line, but there is an introduction sequence and there are some cool events to check out. Some events are planned for future updates and others for 1.0+.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: <u>Are there achievements?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Yes, there are in-game achievements for things such as getting jackpots on machines and other uncommon events. Steam achievements are on the roadmap, as we know they are important to many players. However, their inclusion will depend on technical feasibility and available resources. We appreciate your understanding and will share updates as we work on implementation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: <u>The pixel font is difficult for me to read, can I choose a different font?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: We do have font options! A normal, sans serif font is included by default to make it easier to read things in-game. Menu options however are image-based, and therefore retain their font styles, though a basic menu is also available which will use the font you choose in the options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q: <u>How do the controls work?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: JJC™ has keyboard and mouse support, along with controller compatibility, and touch control for devices with touch screens. There is no custom binding, we wanted to include this, but it conflicted with the build of the game. The controls are very simple, so don't worry about needing to bind or re-bind anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Q:<u> How do I report a bug or issue with the game or launcher?</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: Please make bug reports <u>here on Steam</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                </p>",
